  "notes": "Basis GAAP (accrual statements; manifest guessed cash). Governmental receipts/disbursements from the governmental funds statement (p4) Total column; loan proceeds 70,000 recorded as debt_proceeds and included in printed total revenues 510,418.48. Transfers in 129,000 / out 39,000 (p4); business-type transfers out 90,000 (p6). Business-type receipts/disbursements from p6 Total column; no single printed total so operating + nonoperating added (computed). business_type beginning derived from fund columns (computed) because printed total column omits Electric. ending_cash is governmental funds balance sheet cash 37,151.54 (p3); county treasurer cash 3,766.49 shown separately. Balance sheet uses government-wide Statement of Net Position Totals column (p1); due from/to other funds 98,768 not eliminated as printed. Detail is the all-funds budgetary schedule (p8, only detail schedule), fund 'All funds'; mixed lines were split by governmental / business-type using the report's own breakdowns, budget left on first split item or null. Read pages 1-8 of 8 Detail (user 2026-10-27): per-fund lines from the fund statements' columns (p4, p6) replace the combined schedule."
